  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">cottage cheese bagels are a light, protein-packed spin on a breakfast classic. With a golden, crisp crust and a soft, fluffy center, these homemade bagels get rich flavor and tender texture from creamy cottage cheese worked right into the dough. A touch of honey brings subtle sweetness, and a shower of sesame seeds or everything seasoning adds that bakery-style finish. Spread with cream cheese, pile on avocado, or enjoy warm with a drizzle of olive oil for a simple, satisfying start. Easy to make and wholesome, cottage cheese bagels bring comfort and flavor to any morning routine.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-cottage-cheese-bagels\">Why You’ll Love This Cottage cheese bagels</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-cottage-cheese-bagels\">How to Make Cottage Cheese Bagels</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-cottage-cheese-bagels\">Pro Tips for Making Cottage Cheese Bagels</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-cottage-cheese-bagels\">How to Serve this Cottage cheese bagels</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-cottage-cheese-bagels\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Cottage cheese bagels</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Packed with protein for a satisfying start to your day.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly chewy texture that’s hard to resist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile base for both sweet and savory toppings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, even for beginner bakers!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-4699\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"4699\" data-servings=\"6\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Homemade-Cottage-Cheese-Bagels.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Cottage cheese bagels served with cream cheese and herbs.\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Homemade-Cottage-Cheese-Bagels.webp 500w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Homemade-Cottage-Cheese-Bagels-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Homemade-Cottage-Cheese-Bagels-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Cottage cheese bagels</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Discover the secret to delicious Cottage cheese bagels! Easy recipe, tasty toppings, and a perfect breakfast treat. 🥯✨</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 20px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-contai